{"seq":4,"slug":"fpga-applications","title":"FPGA 应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dsp-acceleration","title":"数字信号处理加速","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-applications/dsp-acceleration","wordCount":1819,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"communication-protocol-implementation","title":"通信协议实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-applications/communication-protocol-implementation","wordCount":1941,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-inference-accelerator","title":"AI 推理加速器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-applications/ai-inference-accelerator","wordCount":2005,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"fpga-应用\">FPGA 应用</h1><p>本章探讨 FPGA 在实际工程中的三大核心应用领域：数字信号处理加速、通信协议实现和 AI 推理加速。通过具体案例展示 FPGA 如何利用其并行性、确定性延迟和可重配置特性解决实际问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章内容\">本章内容</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>数字信号处理加速</strong> — FIR/IIR 滤波器、FFT 变换与波束成形的 FPGA 实现</li>\n<li><strong>通信协议实现</strong> — UART/SPI/I2C 到高速 SerDes 协议的硬件逻辑设计</li>\n<li><strong>AI 推理加速器</strong> — 卷积神经网络量化部署与 FPGA 推理引擎架构</li>\n</ol>\n"}